  "body": "Would it be possible to add `data-dfn-type=\"type\"` to [CSS `<source-size-*>` types](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#source-size-list), so that [`w3c/reffy`](https://github.com/w3c/reffy/) would be able to recognize and extract them from the HTML spec?\r\n\r\nThis attribute is required by the [data model for CSS values (item 4)](https://tabatkins.github.io/bikeshed/#dfn-contract).\r\n\r\nRelated issue: https://github.com/w3c/reffy/issues/1134",
